    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>A collection of useful tools &amp; functions for WordPress site owners.</p>\n<h4>General Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Support Cloudflare Flexible SSL</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Maintenence mode</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Coming soon mode</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Database find and replace</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Expand Smush functions</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>WooCommerce Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Per product Sales Count</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Per User Sales Count</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Order UTM Tracking</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Unzip awtoolkit.zip and upload the folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>The plugin is now active, you can manage options on the Settings page</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"who%20should%20install%20our%20plugin\">\nWho should install our plugin\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Anyone who runs a website built on WordPress.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.20</h4>\n<p>Increase plugin limits</p>\n<h4>1.0.19</h4>\n<p>Security Enhancements</p>\n<h4>1.0.18</h4>\n<p>Fix error on settings page</p>\n<h4>1.0.16</h4>\n<p>Security Enhancements</p>\n<h4>1.0.14</h4>\n<p>Add exceptions to maintenance mode</p>\n<h4>1.0.6</h4>\n<p>Woocommerce plugins per product</p>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<p>Add settings config, maintenence mode and search and replace function</p>\n<h4>0.1.3</h4>\n<p>Add Woocommerce UTM tracking and order count per customer</p>\n<h4>0.1.3</h4>\n<p>Initial Optimisations</p>\n<h4>0.1.1</h4>\n<p>Initial Version</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "AWcode Toolkit provides a collection of useful tools and functions for Wordpress site owners",
